Funny statistics exam answers | 1204.0 | I had a post that was off-topic so removed it. As far as true students' 
mistakes go: I am a grad student and have been teaching into to Econometrics for two semesters. I have seen: complete 
inability of students to work with fractions, things like: 1/2 + 1/3 = 2/5, answers with negative probability, negative 
