well yes mainly from literature and other works on wind for the purpose of wind farms | 2011-02-13 09:08:17.0 | eliavs
judging from the graph, the problem is not the lag. What you have plotted is roughly goodness of fit. So it seems that 
Weibull distribution is not apropriate for your data. I see that there is a bunch up near zero, do you have zero values 
in your data? In that case you will need to model zero values separately. So first suggestion would be to try Weibull 
for non zero values. Also why Weibull, is there particular reason, some reference from similar work perhaps? | 
